Day 45: Personal Expense Tracker (Phase 3 Milestone)

Concepts used: functions, CSV files, try/except, dictionaries with .get(), lists of tuples

This is your Phase 3 milestone. There are no new concepts, only everything from Days 31-44 working together in one program.

Problem Statement
Build an expense tracker that saves all data in expenses.csv, with the header row category,description,amount. Menu:
1. Add Expense
2. View All Expenses
3. Delete an Expense
4. Summary by Category
5. Highest Expense and Total
6. Exit

What each option should do
Add: ask for category, description and amount, then save to the file.
View all: show every expense, numbered.
Delete: show the numbered list, ask which number to delete, confirm with y/n, then remove it.
Summary by category: show the total spent in each category.
Highest and total: show the single biggest expense and the total of everything.
Exit.


